    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Time always runs out. But what if you could try again?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Ripley [Remembered]</i>, you play as <strong>Sage</strong>, a barista trapped in a looping day aboard a train bound for nowhere. Each loop brings new puzzles to solve, strange characters to meet, and unsettling truths to uncover. The passengers don\u2019t know they\u2019re repeating the same day. But you do.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To break the cycle, you'll need to:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solve puzzles that persist through loops</strong> \u2013 Keep key items and knowledge across runs to open new paths and dialogue.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Decipher NPC routines</strong> \u2013 Timed events and tightly interwoven schedules create a reactive world that changes based on your actions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Face psychological boss fights</strong> \u2013 Each fight is a manifestation of trauma, grief, or guilt, brought to life through surreal mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unravel a deeply personal story</strong> \u2013 Themes of memory, loss, and perception are woven into every puzzle, fail state, and hidden file.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dig deeper... if you dare</strong> \u2013 Some truths aren\u2019t visible in-game...</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>This is a game about letting go, and the terrible beauty of holding on.</strong><br>Some loops can\u2019t be broken. But some can.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Interaction-Based Puzzle Gameplay</strong> \u2013 Every interaction moves the clock forward, forcing players to plan their actions wisely.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bullet Hell Boss Fights</strong> \u2013 Intense, rhythmic battles reward players with new inventory items.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psychological Narrative</strong> \u2013 A  mystery about memory, loss, and identity unfolds with each loop.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Persistent Items &amp; Progression</strong> \u2013 Certain items carry over between loops, unlocking new paths and possibilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Train Setting</strong> \u2013 A dreamlike train environment filled with unique NPCs hiding secrets. </p></li></ul>",
